# text = He was as near making away with himself , just where the young lady stands , as near could be He come in at the door on the day he did it -- the whole neighbourhood had said for months before that he would do it , of a certainty sooner or later -- he come in at the door that day , and walked along there , and sat himself on a bench that stood there , and asked me ( you'll judge I was a mortal sight younger then ) to fetch him a pint of wine . ' For ,' says he , ' Krook , I am much depressed ; my cause is on again , and I think I'm nearer judgment than I ever was .'
