# text = If when you first came here , in consequence of our advertisement in the newspapers -- when I say ' our ,' I'm alluding to the advertisements of my friend in the city , and one or two others who embark their capital in the same way , and are so friendly towards me as sometimes to give me a lift with my little pittance -- if at that time you could have helped us , Mr . George , it would have been the making of you I was willing enough to be ' made ,' as you call it but on the whole , I am glad I wasn't now Why , Mr . George ?
