# text = I was born into this unfinished contention with all its chances and changes , and it began to unsettle me before I quite knew the difference between a suit at law and a suit of clothes ; and it has gone on unsettling me ever since ; and here I am now , conscious sometimes that I am but a worthless fellow to love my confiding cousin Ada Oh , Richard Do not be so moved .
