# text = Therefore , before communicating further with my son , I take the liberty of saying that if her removal would be in any way inconvenient or objectionable , I will hold the matter over with him for any reasonable time and leave it precisely where it is Am I to understand , sir and is my Lady to understand am I to understand , Mr . Rouncewell , and is my Lady to understand , sir , that you consider this young woman too good for Chesney Wold or likely to be injured by remaining here Certainly not , Sir Leicester I am glad to hear it Pray , Mr . Rouncewell explain to me what you mean Willingly , Lady Dedlock .
