# text = And I am very well indeed , and very happy Stubbs , I am surprised you don't canter when you know how much I like it ; and I think you might oblige me , for you are only getting stupid and going to sleep Now , Stubbs , I feel quite sure from what I know of you that you will go on if I ride a little while Mother , why is the lady not a pretty lady now like she used to be He's a dear good fellow , miss ; but he can't write yet -- he's going to learn of me -- and I wouldn't shame him for the world Miss Summerson , I am afraid I have startled you You can scarcely be strong yet .
