# text = Don't you see that he is an interested party and that it may be very well for him to wish me to know nothing of the suit , and care nothing about it , but that it may not be quite so well for me Oh , Richard is it possible that you can ever have seen him and heard him , that you can ever have lived under his roof and known him , and can yet breathe , even to me in this solitary place where there is no one to hear us , such unworthy suspicions Esther , I am sure you know that I am not a mean fellow and that I have some sense of suspicion and distrust being poor qualities in one of my years I know it very well I am not more sure of anything
