# text = Equally , last night , when her ladyship , as is so universally admired I am sure , come home looking -- why , Lord , a man might almost say like Venus rising from the ocean -- it was so unpleasant and inconsistent to think of her being charged with a murder of which she was innocent that I felt quite to want to put an end to the job .
