# text = My Lady , my good Lady I am so humble in my place and you are by nature so high and distant that you may not think what I feel for my child , but I feel so much that I have come here to make so bold as to beg and pray you not to be scornful of us if you can do us any right or justice at this fearful time Am I to read this When I am gone , my Lady , if you please , and then remembering the most that I consider possible I know of nothing I can do .
