# text = And never believe , dear dear Mr . Woodcourt , never believe that I forget this night or that while my heart beats it can be insensible to the pride and joy of having been beloved by you I am induced by what you said just now to hope that you have succeeded in your endeavour I have With such help from Mr . Jarndyce as you who know him so well can imagine him to have rendered me , I have succeeded Heaven bless him for it and heaven bless you in all you do I shall do it better for the wish it will make me enter on these new duties as on another sacred trust from you Ah !
