# text = I am now admitted ( after undergoing an examination that's enough to badger a man blue , touching a pack of nonsense that he don't want to know ) on the roll of attorneys and have taken out my certificate , if it would be any satisfaction to you to see it Thank you , Mr . Guppy I am quite willing -- I believe I use a legal phrase -- to admit the certificate I have no capital myself , but my mother has a little property which takes the form of an annuity and a few pounds for expenses out of pocket in conducting business will never be wanting , free of interest , which is an advantage , you know Certainly an advantage I HAVE some connexion and it lays in the direction of Walcot Square , Lambeth .
